T*
() Tj
T*
(By the Trillion Man Outreach kitchen crew Updated October 8, 2026) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Some nights you have a little gas in the tank. Other nights you are running on fumes and) Tj
T*
(the idea of chopping an onion feels personal. This guide sorts easy dinners by how much) Tj
T*
(energy you actually have, so you can pick the right one in seconds and skip the guilt.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(First, lower the bar \(on purpose\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A good tired-night dinner has three traits: five ingredients or fewer, one pan or plate,) Tj
T*
(and no step that needs your full attention. Cereal for dinner is not a failure. But a) Tj
T*
(hot meal usually feels better, and most of the ideas below take under 15 minutes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Running on fumes: 5 to 10 minutes, almost no cooking) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Microwave sweet potato with black beans.) Tj
T*
(Poke a large sweet potato with a fork, microwave 6 to 8 minutes, split it and top with) Tj
T*
(warmed canned black beans, cheese and salsa. Our) Tj
T*
(full recipe) Tj
T*
(has every step.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cheese quesadillas.) Tj
T*
(Cheese between two tortillas, 2 to 3 minutes per side in a skillet. Add canned beans or) Tj
T*
(leftover chicken if you have them.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Breakfast for dinner.) Tj
T*
(Scrambled eggs, toast and a piece of fruit. Eggs are fully cooked when no runny parts) Tj
T*
(remain.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Snack-plate dinner.) Tj
T*
(Cheese, crackers, sliced deli turkey, baby carrots and apple slices. Nobody has ever) Tj
T*
(been mad at a snack plate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tuna melts.) Tj
T*
(Mix canned tuna with a spoonful of mayo, pile on bread with cheese and broil or toast) Tj
T*
(until bubbly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mostly upright: 15 to 30 minutes, one pan) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Egg fried rice.) Tj
T*
(Cold leftover rice, frozen peas and carrots, scrambled eggs and soy sauce. Cold rice) Tj
T*
(fries better than fresh because it does not turn gummy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
